sequenceDiagram
participant Complaint as "complaintService: Service"
participant Payment as "paymentService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Complaint->>Payment: applyApprovedAdjustment(orderId, quantity, reason)
Payment->>DB: Read allocated net unit price and remaining unadjusted value
Payment->>DB: Validate delivered quantity, cap and idempotency
alt Adjustment within cap
    Payment->>DB: Post financial adjustment and recalculate receivable
    alt Confirmed payments exceed adjusted amount
        Payment->>DB: Create PendingRefund obligation
    end
    DB-->>Complaint: Adjustment applied
else Duplicate or exceeds cap
    DB-->>Complaint: Conflict, no duplicate adjustment
end


